MemorY

The package internal/explorer (the place of a memory slot from its SMBIOS locator, the readers of
lshw, numactl, numastat, sysfs cache and /proc text, and the layout of the board) is carried over
from the Memory Explorer of aterm, a terminal for system engineers by the same author, and is
licensed here under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The test data under testdata/explorer comes from public repositories under their own licences.
testdata/explorer/README.md names the source and the licence of each file, and the licence texts
are in testdata/explorer/LICENSES.
